Depending on the intended application and metal alloy of the produced part, various post-processing techniques may be applied (Chapter 5). For L-PBF, the primary processes to consider are powder removal, support removal, heat treatments, build-plate removal, machining, and surface finish enhancement. A more detailed discussion of post-processing can be found in Chapter 5.
